     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "scene": "tract",
    "sentences": [
     {
      "text": "Pus can drain through a thin channel to the gum. It may hurt only a little.",
      "cite": [
       1
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "scene": "treat",
    "sentences": [
     {
      "text": "Root canal treatment cleans and seals the canals. Then the bone can heal, over months or years.",
      "cite": [
       1,
       2
      ]
     }
